      m('Trust and red flags usually show up in how questions are handled', ['trust','red flags'], 'A strong evaluator should be able to answer basic fit questions without acting like you are challenging them. Dismissiveness and vagueness are useful red flags.', ['Notice whether your questions improve clarity', 'Ask what would make them a poor fit for your case', 'Compare more than one option if the first call feels off'], ['They act irritated by basic process questions'])
